WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
An unfamiliar address or device can reveal a gap between observed activity and known inventory.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Distinguish the unknown device from the known device that reported seeing it.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
An unexplained record could reflect an inventory gap, an expected device or something requiring attention.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Review the evidence and establish the device identity, owner and place in the terrain.
